menu "Simple gps tracker Configuration"
    config WEB_PAGE_MOUNT_POINT_IN_FS
        string "Website mount point in VFS"
        default "/www"
        help
            Specify the mount point in VFS.

    config DEPLOY_CAPTIVE_PORTAL
        bool "Deploy web pages using wifi AP"
        default y
        help
            If enabled, the wifiAP will be initialize and the captive portal deployed
            Ensure that the necessary files (html, css, js, etc.) are available in the `frontend/dist` directory.
endmenu
